  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>BAR MANAGER</strong></p><p><br>​<strong>Mission:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Responsible for the bar outlets during their time slot, leading the operations of the assigned consumption centers, ensuring good management and customer experience.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What will you have to do?</strong></p><p>·         Manage daily operations of the bar outlets.</p><p>·         Oversee daily and monthly inventory of glassware, dishware, cutlery, and decorations.</p><p>·         Ensure accurate reporting of inventory and department performance.</p><p>·         Supervise preventive maintenance and deep cleaning of bar equipment.</p><p>·         Manage menus, liquor lists, and department promotions.</p><p>·         Ensure proper operation of bar machines and equipment.</p><p>·         Ensure compliance with hygiene, safety, and company standards.</p><p>·         Monitor department budget and financial results.</p><p>·         Help with the training and development of staff.</p><p>·         Maintain excellent customer service and personalize guest experiences.</p><p>·         Handle customer complaints and escalate issues when needed.</p><p>·         Be aware of hotel services, entertainment, and events, and keep the team informed.<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What we are looking for?</strong></p><p>·         Higher degree and/or university degree, preferably Tourism or Hospitality, or similar.</p><p>·         Albanian and advanced English, a third language will be highly valuable.</p><p>·         Knowledge of the F&B area, both the waiting service (restaurant) and the bar.</p><p>·         Knowledge of cashiers' closing and reconciliation, stock management, and ordering.</p><p>·         Knowledge of the latest bars trends.</p><p>·         Ability to ensure health and safety procedures (HACCP).</p><p>·         Cost control/ management.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·         Knowledge of REVO, and POS management.</p><p>·         Advanced command of the Office 365 package</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·         Knowledge of hotel operations.</p><p>·         Ability to work in a team, service and quality oriented, professionalism, global and strategic vision and communication and influence as key competencies. Creativity and innovation.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">·         At least 1-2 years’ experience in a similar position, in the sector.</p>",
